  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "宜蘭ê米粉羹、魚丸kap草仔粿"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>李麗華</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮爸爸是宜蘭人，uì 16歲就到台北學師仔修理車。後--來，伊若tshuā阮tńg去宜蘭，lóng愛tshuā阮去食米粉羹、買魚丸kap草仔粿。宜蘭ê米粉羹是tsiok在地ê食mi̍h，親像台北ê蚵仔麵線仝款。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-koh宜蘭米粉羹ê麵線是用khah粗ê米粉，大骨、柴魚先去kûn湯，摻木耳絲、筍絲、紅菜頭簽kap肉羹了後，tsiah-koh牽羹。Khat tī碗公內，lâm淡薄仔烏醋、囥一點仔芫荽，就tsiok好食。阮爸爸逐擺tńg--去，lóng ài去永和寺邊--a ê擔仔食一大碗tsiah歡喜。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮爸爸koh ē tshuā阮去羅東市場前買魚丸，伊講宜蘭ê魚丸是正港鯊魚去拍--ê，食--起-來khah芳。一擺伊lóng ài買十外斤帶tńg來台北。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Suà--落-來，koh ài去冬山買草仔粿。阮爸爸講宜蘭粿kap台北--ê做法無仝。台北--ê是tsu̍t米漿包餡了後囥tī lâng-sn̂g去炊，tsit款--ê囥到下晡就tīng--去--ah。宜蘭--ê是tsu̍t米漿炊了ài去絞--過tsiah包餡，現買現包，皮khah khiū，ē-sái囥三工，皮bē tīng--去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit三項就是阮兜上愛食ê mih仔。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>（作者是永和小小書房台語課學員）</b></span></p><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjMCzXzzPXozYCLySU91DrZOYmFEoT1E5cubpH_QXapHcxNwRbqPf8AaK4pSo1j4mV1CkA6C67q2pJOWpth3LrXsnCj45xnTogQUTlppHBhxEA-zOhUcQ1EwUEjXQvtcT0mTlgAlRSadye6H0aY4lA18Eh11AkxQb8DI9jk2EM-fK2jYai4wEnaNjalbw/s1421/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjMCzXzzPXozYCLySU91DrZOYmFEoT1E5cubpH_QXapHcxNwRbqPf8AaK4pSo1j4mV1CkA6C67q2pJOWpth3LrXsnCj45xnTogQUTlppHBhxEA-zOhUcQ1EwUEjXQvtcT0mTlgAlRSadye6H0aY4lA18Eh11AkxQb8DI9jk2EM-fK2jYai4wEnaNjalbw/w450-h640/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjm9YXKZz0AOzZxLXr86AfTL1lJYMyRT6vg61Wx9jpEOJbsgnDLW740uJNIPLq_fdvNpcWBmtOxN8PrGPLipZ7UzU25VxW7WHkq0OnHZeQzd0Wd4KT43beMgVQUZ5Ht_RIqXytkpFIOODIEu-D6nPjcErqsZITpc7cC70q5gxq6L0LQWuD9kwSSMprk4Q/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1342%E6%9C%9F_011.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjm9YXKZz0AOzZxLXr86AfTL1lJYMyRT6vg61Wx9jpEOJbsgnDLW740uJNIPLq_fdvNpcWBmtOxN8PrGPLipZ7UzU25VxW7WHkq0OnHZeQzd0Wd4KT43beMgVQUZ5Ht_RIqXytkpFIOODIEu-D6nPjcErqsZITpc7cC70q5gxq6L0LQWuD9kwSSMprk4Q/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1342%E6%9C%9F_011.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><b